{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04547","headline":"四月十三日诏宴宁王亭子赋得好字 · 张说","name":"四月十三日诏宴宁王亭子赋得好字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何许承恩宴，山亭风日好。\n绿嫩鸣鹤洲，阴穠鬬鸡道。\n果思夏来茂，花嫌春去早。\n行乐无限时，皇情及芳草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}